@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api

### Login as admin (get token)
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@edu.local",
  "password": "password123"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("authToken", response.body.token);
%}

### List disciplines
GET {{baseUrl}}/disciplines
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Create discipline
POST {{baseUrl}}/disciplines
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Комп'ютерні мережі"
}

### Update discipline (заміни id на потрібний)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/disciplines/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Програмування (оновлено)"
}
